# FreeSWITCH Integration — Full Re-Audit Report (Final)

**Date:** 2026-04-24  
**Scope:** Every telephony-related file across backend (NestJS) and frontend (Next.js)  
**Status:** ✅ **100% Code-Complete**

---

## Executive Summary

The FreeSWITCH integration is **fully code-complete at 100%**. All previously-identified gaps have been resolved:
- All stub methods replaced with real ESL commands
- WebSocket gateway fully orchestrates call lifecycle through FreeSWITCH
- Both CRM pages use the production SIP.js softphone
- Legacy softphone deleted
- DTMF, silent monitor, ringtone, and adaptive pacing all implemented
- TURN credentials externalized to environment variables

---

## ✅ Backend (NestJS) — File-by-File Audit

### 1. ESL Connection Layer — [freeswitch.service.ts](file:///home/ratnesh-mishra/Desktop/Karan-Saas/backend/src/telephony/freeswitch.service.ts) (265 lines)

| Feature | Status | Details |
|---|---|---|
| ESL Connection | ✅ Complete | `modesl@1.2.1` — `new esl.Connection(host, port, password)` with callback |
| `isConnected` getter | ✅ Real | Tracks `_isConnected` boolean + `!!this.connection` |
| Reconnection | ✅ Complete | Exponential backoff (1s→30s cap), max 10 attempts |
| Cleanup | ✅ Complete | `onModuleDestroy()` clears timer, disconnects, nulls connection |
| `ensureConnection()` guard | ✅ Complete | All ESL commands throw clear error if disconnected |
| Event: `CHANNEL_ANSWER` | ✅ Wired | Emits `freeswitch.call.answered` via EventEmitter2 |
| Event: `CHANNEL_HANGUP` | ✅ Wired | Emits `freeswitch.call.hungup` via EventEmitter2 |
| Event: `CHANNEL_BRIDGE` | ✅ Wired | Emits `freeswitch.call.bridged` |
| Event: `RECORD_START` | ✅ Wired | Emits `freeswitch.recording.started` |
| Event: `RECORD_STOP` | ✅ Wired | Emits `freeswitch.recording.stopped` |
| `originateCall()` | ✅ Real ESL | `bgapi originate` with sofia gateway, returns Job-UUID |
| `bridgeCall()` | ✅ Real ESL | `uuid_bridge` |
| `playAudio()` | ✅ Real ESL | `uuid_broadcast` aleg |
| `hangup()` | ✅ Real ESL | `uuid_kill` |
| `transfer()` | ✅ Real ESL | `uuid_transfer` |
| `muteCall()` | ✅ Real ESL | `uuid_audio {uuid} start/stop read mute` |
| `holdCall()` | ✅ Real ESL | `uuid_hold {uuid}` |
| `unholdCall()` | ✅ Real ESL | `uuid_hold off {uuid}` |
| `startRecording()` | ✅ Real ESL | `uuid_record {uuid} start {path}` |
| `stopRecording()` | ✅ Real ESL | `uuid_record {uuid} stop {path}` |
| `eavesdropWhisper()` | ✅ Real ESL | `originate user/{ext}@{domain} &eavesdrop({uuid})` |
| `bargeIn()` | ✅ Real ESL | `uuid_transfer` to conference + `originate` supervisor |
| `silentMonitor()` | ✅ Real ESL | Eavesdrop with `eavesdrop_whisper_aleg=false,eavesdrop_whisper_bleg=false` |
| `sendDtmf()` | ✅ Real ESL | `uuid_send_dtmf {uuid} {digits}@{duration}` |

**Total: 14 ESL command wrappers** — all production-ready.

