### 4. WebSocket Gateway — [telephony.gateway.ts](file:///home/ratnesh-mishra/Desktop/Karan-Saas/backend/src/telephony/telephony.gateway.ts) (174 lines)

| WS Event | Direction | Status | Wired To |
|---|---|---|---|
| `join_room` | Client→Server | ✅ | Tenant-scoped Socket.io room join |
| `call:initiate` | Client→Server | ✅ | `telephonyService.initiateCall()` → FreeSWITCH ESL |
| `call:answer` | Client→Server | ✅ | `telephonyService.markCallAnswered()` → Prisma |
| `call:hangup` | Client→Server | ✅ | `telephonyService.hangupCall()` → FreeSWITCH + Prisma |
| `call:mute` | Client→Server | ✅ | `telephonyService.muteCall()` → ESL `uuid_audio` |
| `call:hold` | Client→Server | ✅ | `telephonyService.holdCall()` → ESL `uuid_hold` |
| `call:transfer` | Client→Server | ✅ | `telephonyService.transferCall()` → ESL `uuid_transfer` |
| `call:status` | Server→Client | ✅ | Broadcasts CONNECTING/INCALL/IDLE/TRANSFERRED |
| `call:mute_status` | Server→Client | ✅ | Broadcasts mute state |
| `call:hold_status` | Server→Client | ✅ | Broadcasts hold state |
| `call:error` | Server→Client | ✅ | Broadcasts error messages |
| `call:event` | Server→Client | ✅ | Agent + supervisor room broadcast |
| `bi:live_metrics` | Server→Client | ✅ | Global wallboard BI via `@OnEvent` |
| `ping/pong` | Bidirectional | ✅ | Health check |

