## ✅ Frontend (Next.js) — File-by-File Audit

### 11. SIP.js WebRTC Hook — [useSoftphone.ts](file:///home/ratnesh-mishra/Desktop/Karan-Saas/frontend/src/hooks/useSoftphone.ts) (312 lines)

| Feature | Status | Details |
|---|---|---|
| SIP.js `UserAgent` creation | ✅ | WSS transport, ICE servers, auth password |
| `Registerer` lifecycle | ✅ | Register on start, unregister on cleanup |
| Outbound `Inviter` | ✅ | Full state machine |
| Inbound `Invitation` handling | ✅ | Ring/accept/reject flow |
| `acceptIncoming()` | ✅ | `invitation.accept()` with media attachment |
| `rejectIncoming()` | ✅ | `invitation.reject()` + clear state |
| Remote cancellation | ✅ | Listens for `SessionState.Terminated` |
| `call()` | ✅ | Creates `Inviter`, attaches state listener |
| `hangup()` | ✅ | `bye()` for established, `cancel()` for establishing |
| `mute()` | ✅ | Toggles `sender.track.enabled` |
| `hold()` | ✅ | Toggles senders + receivers |
| `sendDtmf()` | ✅ **New** | SIP INFO with `application/dtmf-relay` |
| `attachRemoteMedia()` | ✅ | Attaches `<audio id="remoteAudio">` |
| **Ringtone audio** | ✅ **New** | AudioContext oscillator, plays on inbound, stops on accept/reject/cancel |

