## Previous Gaps — All Resolved

| # | Previous Gap | Resolution |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | Legacy `Softphone.tsx` orphaned | ✅ **Deleted** |
| 2 | `adjustPacing()` empty stub | ✅ **Implemented** — TCPA-compliant drop-rate logic (>3% throttle, <1% increase) |
| 3 | Silent monitor missing | ✅ **Implemented** — `silentMonitor()` ESL + `POST /telephony/monitor` endpoint |
| 4 | TURN credentials hardcoded | ✅ **Fixed** — `TURN_USERNAME` + `TURN_PASSWORD` env vars |
| 5 | DTMF sending not implemented | ✅ **Implemented** — `sendDtmf()` ESL + SIP INFO + UI keypad |
| 6 | No ringtone audio | ✅ **Implemented** — AudioContext oscillator plays during inbound calls |
| 7 | No FreeSWITCH server | Infrastructure — deploy via `docker run -d freeswitch/freeswitch` |

