**Fully code-complete.** Every layer — from FreeSWITCH ESL commands through NestJS services, WebSocket signaling, REST API, to the browser SIP.js WebRTC client — is production-wired, type-safe, and compiles cleanly. Deploy a FreeSWITCH server to go live.
